{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10318","headline":"塞上 · 高适","name":"塞上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东出卢龙塞，浩然客思孤。\n亭堠列万里，汉兵犹备胡。\n边尘涨北溟，虏骑正南驱。\n转鬬岂长策，和亲非远图。\n惟昔李将军，按节出皇都。\n总戎扫大漠，一战擒单于。\n常怀感激心，愿效纵横谟。\n倚劒欲谁语，关河空郁纡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10318.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10318","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}